%changelog
* Wed Aug 5 2026 RIPE Atlas Team <atlas@ripe.net> - 1.5-6
- Debian: move apt source from the legacy .list to the deb822 .sources format
- Debian: scope the signing key to this repository via Signed-By, shipping it in
  /usr/share/keyrings instead of the globally trusted /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d
- Debian: remove the obsolete .list and trusted.gpg.d key conffiles on upgrade
- Debian: declare ca-certificates as a binary package dependency (was silently
  dropped from the source stanza)
- Debian: stop the packaged changelog being trimmed on Debian 12+, keeping
  apt changelog working
- Debian: update the uploaders in the control file

* Mon Oct 27 2025 RIPE Atlas Team <atlas@ripe.net> - 1.5-5
- Improve branch/tag handling and add comments in ripe-atlas-repo.spec

* Mon Oct 27 2025 RIPE Atlas Team <atlas@ripe.net> - 1.5-4
- Add EL10 support

* Wed Mar 26 2025 RIPE Atlas Team <atlas@ripe.net> - 1.5-3
- Remove deprecated signing key for RHEL packages

* Tue Sep 24 2024 RIPE Atlas Team <atlas@ripe.net> - 1.5-2
- Initial version after restructuring
